#!/bin/sh

cat <<'EOF'
Ghostty + tmux help

Keys: ⌘ Command   ⌥ Option   ⇧ Shift   ⌃ Control

Ghostty
  ⌘K                    Clear the screen and scrollback
  ⌘L                    Clear the visible screen
  ⌘A                    Copy all tmux scrollback to the clipboard
  ⇧← / ⇧→               Select the previous / next outer tab
  ⌘F                    Fuzzy-search tmux scrollback
  ⌘↑ / ⌘↓               Scroll tmux history one line
  ⌘⇧↑ / ⌘⇧↓             Scroll tmux history half a page
  ⌘⇧← / ⌘⇧→             Move the outer tab left / right
  ⌘← / ⌘→               Focus the Ghostty split to the left / right
  ⌘⇧R                   Rename the current Ghostty surface

Tab groups (Ghostty shortcuts)
  ⌘⌥T                   Create an inner tab
  ⌘⌥← / ⌘⌥→             Select the previous / next inner tab
  ⌘⌥R                   Rename the inner tab
  ⌘⌥G                   Rename the outer tab group
  ⌘⌥⇧← / ⌘⌥⇧→           Merge this group into the group on the left / right
  ⌘⌥⇧↑                  Pop the current inner tab into a new outer group
  ⌘⌥⇧↓                  Toggle all inner tabs as tiled panes
  ⌘⌥B                   Save the current group as a bookmark
  ⌘⌥⇧B                  Choose and open a saved bookmark

tmux equivalents
  ⌃A                    Prefix (replaces ⌃B); press twice to send ⌃A
  ⌃K                    Clear the screen and scrollback (no prefix)
  Prefix f              Fuzzy-search scrollback
  Prefix [              Enter copy mode; use vi movement and y to copy
  Prefix C              Copy all scrollback to the clipboard
  Prefix c              Create an inner tab in the current directory
  Prefix p / n          Select the previous / next inner tab or tiled pane
  Prefix ,              Rename the inner tab
  Prefix G / O          Merge this group left / right
  Prefix P              Pop the current inner tab into a new group
  Prefix T              Toggle tiled panes
  Prefix B              Save this group as a bookmark
  Prefix V              Choose and open a saved bookmark

Commands
  help                              Show this help
  tab-groups merge left|right       Merge this group into an adjacent group
  tab-groups pop                    Pop this inner tab into a new group
  tab-groups panes                  Toggle all inner tabs as tiled panes
  tab-groups bookmark save [NAME]   Save this group (defaults to its tab name)
  tab-groups bookmark choose        Choose and open a bookmark
  tab-groups bookmark open NAME     Open a bookmark by name
  tab-groups bookmark list          List saved bookmarks

Outer tabs are Ghostty tabs. Inner tabs are tmux windows inside each outer tab.
EOF
